<title>ITALY: Gross yield 7.56 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 7.56 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 16 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     7.56	(7.85)    98.13	  (98.08)</p>
<p>    6-month     7.64	(7.97)    96.33	  (96.24)</p>
<p>    1-year	7.53	(7.93)    93.00	  (92.65)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on September 25.</p>
</text>
